	(footprint "Mylib:WS2812B-4020-V6"
		(layer "B.Cu")
		(uuid "2d9e1102-4aec-46df-862b-ef4febbac43d")
		(at 90 133 180)
		(descr "Side view smart LED, WS2812B-4020-V6. NOT interchangeable with the WS2812B-4020: feet at -1.675/-0.425/+0.600/+1.675, 0.65/0.60/0.35/0.65 wide, where the older drawing has four 0.41mm feet on a 0.85 pitch. Pin 1 (DIN) is at -x here and at +x there, and the body is on the other side of the pads, so the two sit 180 degrees apart. Pads are 0.25mm wider than their feet, giving 0.125mm of side fillet where the older land pattern gave none. Geometry from EasyEDA's terminal and body layers, checked against the LCSC datasheet. No 3D model: EasyEDA has none for this revision, and the older part's STEP is the wrong shape.")
